            "text": "CHOP to VOL — Channel Data as Voxels\n\nCHOPtoVOL maps channel sample data into a 3D volume.\nLFO + NoiseCHOP merged provide multi-channel input.\n\nUse mapping modes to control how CHOP samples are\ndistributed across voxel slices. The result is raymarched\nfor visual feedback — useful for audio-reactive volumes\nor data-driven volumetric effects.",
